{"id":"a615da359228a285","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-pcf4-directed-product.md","title":"ZFC Pcf4 Directed Product","display":"df-zfc-pcf4-directed-product — ZFC Pcf4 Directed Product","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf4-directed-product","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf4-directed-product"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf4-directed-product — ZFC Pcf4 Directed Product","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-ideal]]","[[58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order]]","[[58-df-zfc-pcf3-reduced-product]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf4-directed-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf4-directed-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf4-directed-product — ZFC Pcf4 Directed Product"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fd3c35fd522d89ac\" href=\"?note=fd3c35fd522d89ac\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order\">58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a2431acf52348150\" href=\"?note=a2431acf52348150\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf3-reduced-product\">58-df-zfc-pcf3-reduced-product</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (pcf product index set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> (eventual-order parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_J\">\\(\\leq_J\\)</span> (non-strict reduced-product order modulo <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\)</span> (ideal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S\\)</span> (reduced-product order, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fd3c35fd522d89ac\" href=\"?note=fd3c35fd522d89ac\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order\">58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4DirectedProduct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4DirectedProduct}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}directed\\text{-}product}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4DirectedProduct}_S(A,J,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(a)\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(J,\\mathcal P(A))\\land A\\notin J\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa\\ne0\\land\\forall X\\in[\\prod A]^{&lt;\\kappa}\\;\\exists g\\in\\prod A\\;\\forall f\\in X\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S(A,J,f,g)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}directed\\text{-}product}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4DirectedProduct}_S(A,J,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(a)\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(J,\\mathcal P(A))\\land A\\notin J\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa\\ne0\\land\\forall X\\in[\\prod A]^{&lt;\\kappa}\\;\\exists g\\in\\prod A\\;\\forall f\\in X\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S(A,J,f,g)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The last clause calls the canonical <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\leq_Jg\">\\(f\\leq_Jg\\)</span> predicate; a directed upper bound is non-strict and need not strictly dominate every member.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ideal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order","status":"resolved","id":"fd3c35fd522d89ac","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-reduced-product","status":"resolved","id":"a2431acf52348150","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-pcf3-reduced-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa$ (cardinal, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ideal}$ (ideal predicate, see [[58-df-ideal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order","status":"resolved","id":"fd3c35fd522d89ac","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S$ (reduced-product order, see [[58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_J","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4DirectedProduct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}directed\\text{-}product}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4DirectedProduct}_S(A,J,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(a)\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(J,\\mathcal P(A))\\land A\\notin J\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa\\ne0\\land\\forall X\\in[\\prod A]^{<\\kappa}\\;\\exists g\\in\\prod A\\;\\forall f\\in X\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S(A,J,f,g)","display":true},{"tex":"f\\leq_Jg","display":false}],"bytes":1458,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3084","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-pcf4-directed-product.md|58-df-zfc-pcf4-directed-product]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5fb1c2241d1943d1","6e4f95381faac4f9","fd3c35fd522d89ac","a2431acf52348150"]}